msgid "lerobot_ros2"
msgstr "lerobot_ros2"

msgid "LeRobot ↔ ROS 2 integration monorepo. LeRobot talks to the robot over ROS 2 topics."
msgstr "LeRobot 与 ROS 2 的集成单体仓库。LeRobot 通过 ROS 2 话题与机器人通信。"

msgid "Documented branch"
msgstr "文档所依据的分支"

msgid "Documented against branch `feature/sim-grasp-datagen` (tip 2026-09-20). That branch is newer than `main`; follow it, not `main`."
msgstr "本文档对照分支 `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`（尖端提交 2026-09-20）。该分支新于 `main`；请以它为准，不要跟 `main`。"

msgid "**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2 @ `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/tree/feature/sim-grasp-datagen)"
msgstr "**仓库：** [fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2 @ `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/tree/feature/sim-grasp-datagen)"

msgid "**README:** [README.md on this branch](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-datagen/README.md)"
msgstr "**README：** [README.md on this branch](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-datagen/README.md)"

msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

msgid "This checkout is a monorepo, not a single `pip install -e .` package. It wires:"
msgstr "本仓库是单体工程，不是在仓库根目录执行一次 `pip install -e .` 就能装好的包。它包含："

msgid "`submodules/ros2_robot_interface` — ROS 2 robot interface"
msgstr "`submodules/ros2_robot_interface`：独立 ROS 2 机器人接口包"

msgid "`submodules/robot_action_composer` — task-queue YAML and motion generation (see [robot_action_composer](5-robot_action_composer.md))"
msgstr "`submodules/robot_action_composer`：任务队列 YAML 与运动生成（见 [robot_action_composer](5-robot_action_composer.md)）"

msgid "`lerobot_robot_ros2` — LeRobot ROS 2 robot plugin (`ROS2Robot` / `ROS2RobotConfig` / `ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig`)"
msgstr "`lerobot_robot_ros2`：LeRobot 的 ROS 2 机器人插件（`ROS2Robot` / `ROS2RobotConfig` / `ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig`）"

msgid "`lerobot_camera_ros2` — LeRobot ROS 2 camera plugin"
msgstr "`lerobot_camera_ros2`：LeRobot 的 ROS 2 相机插件"

msgid "The LeRobot core library is installed from PyPI. The default pin is `lerobot==0.5.1` in `.fa-env.toml` (first created from [`.fa-env.toml.example`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-datagen/.fa-env.toml.example))."
msgstr "LeRobot 核心库从 PyPI 安装。默认版本钉在 `.fa-env.toml` 中的 `lerobot==0.5.1`（首次由 [`.fa-env.toml.example`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-datagen/.fa-env.toml.example) 生成）。"

msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "前置要求"

msgid "ROS 2 (tested: **Jazzy**)"
msgstr "ROS 2（测试版本：**Jazzy**）"

msgid "Python **≥ 3.12**"
msgstr "Python **≥ 3.12**"

msgid "[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (recommended) or Conda"
msgstr "[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)（推荐）或 Conda"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

msgid "Clone with submodules, then use `init.sh`. Do **not** treat `pip install -e .` at the repo root as the install path."
msgstr "先带 submodule 克隆，再用 `init.sh`。**不要**把仓库根目录的 `pip install -e .` 当作安装路径。"

msgid ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"\n"
"# uv if needed: curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\n"
"\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
"# motion / task queue only (no LeRobot):  ./init.sh all-motion\n"
"# recording / inference plugins:          ./init.sh install-lerobot\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate   # default backend=uv"
msgstr ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"\n"
"# uv if needed: curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\n"
"\n"
"./init.sh all\n"
"# motion / task queue only (no LeRobot):  ./init.sh all-motion\n"
"# recording / inference plugins:          ./init.sh install-lerobot\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate   # default backend=uv"

msgid "`./init.sh` with no arguments opens an interactive menu (submodules, env, install, backend, ROS 2 workspace). Useful non-interactive commands from the README:"
msgstr "`./init.sh` 不带参数会进入交互菜单（子模块、环境、安装、backend、ROS 2 工作空间）。README 中常用的非交互命令："

msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

msgid "`./init.sh all`"
msgstr "`./init.sh all`"

msgid "Submodules + env + task orchestration + LeRobot plugins"
msgstr "子模块 + 环境 + 任务编排 + LeRobot 插件"

msgid "`./init.sh all-motion`"
msgstr "`./init.sh all-motion`"

msgid "Submodules + env + `ros2_robot_interface` + `robot_action_composer` only"
msgstr "仅子模块 + 环境 + `ros2_robot_interface` + `robot_action_composer`"

msgid "`./init.sh install-lerobot`"
msgstr "`./init.sh install-lerobot`"

msgid "PyTorch + PyPI `lerobot` + `lerobot_robot_ros2` / `lerobot_camera_ros2`"
msgstr "PyTorch + PyPI `lerobot` + `lerobot_robot_ros2` / `lerobot_camera_ros2`"

msgid "`./init.sh set-backend uv`"
msgstr "`./init.sh set-backend uv`"

msgid "Write `backend` in `.fa-env.toml` (`uv` or `conda`)"
msgstr "写入 `.fa-env.toml` 中的 `backend`（`uv` 或 `conda`）"

msgid "Runtime config lives in local `.fa-env.toml` (gitignored; copied from the example). Keys documented in the README:"
msgstr "运行时配置在本地 `.fa-env.toml`（已 gitignore；从示例复制）。README 中记录的键："

msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置项"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "说明"

msgid "`backend`"
msgstr "`backend`"

msgid "`uv` or `conda`"
msgstr "`uv` 或 `conda`"

msgid "`[conda].name`"
msgstr "`[conda].name`"

msgid "Conda env name (default `lerobot-ros2`)"
msgstr "conda 环境名（默认 `lerobot-ros2`）"

msgid "`[uv].venv`"
msgstr "`[uv].venv`"

msgid "uv venv path (default `.venv`)"
msgstr "uv 虚拟环境路径（默认 `.venv`）"

msgid "`[lerobot].version`"
msgstr "`[lerobot].version`"

msgid "PyPI LeRobot version (default `0.5.1`)"
msgstr "PyPI lerobot 版本（默认 `0.5.1`）"

msgid "`[ros2].workspace`"
msgstr "`[ros2].workspace`"

msgid "ROS 2 workspace; sourced when the env is activated"
msgstr "ROS 2 工作空间；激活环境时自动 source"

msgid "Personal overrides: `.fa-env.local.toml`. Env notes: [docs/ENV_THIS_CHECKOUT.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-datagen/docs/ENV_THIS_CHECKOUT.md)."
msgstr "个人覆盖：`.fa-env.local.toml`。环境说明：[docs/ENV_THIS_CHECKOUT.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/feature/sim-grasp-datagen/docs/ENV_THIS_CHECKOUT.md)。"

msgid "Manual install (uv)"
msgstr "手动安装（uv）"

msgid "If you skip `init.sh`, the README's uv path is: create `.venv` with `--system-site-packages`, then install local packages with **`--no-deps`** so pip does not try to fetch `rclpy` from PyPI. ROS Python packages come from the sourced Jazzy overlay."
msgstr "若跳过 `init.sh`，README 的 uv 路径是：用 `--system-site-packages` 创建 `.venv`，本地包加 **`--no-deps`**，避免 pip 去 PyPI 拉 `rclpy`。ROS Python 包来自已 source 的 Jazzy overlay。"

msgid ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"\n"
"uv venv --python python3.12 --system-site-packages .venv\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"\n"
"uv pip install torch==2.7.1 torchvision==0.22.1 torchaudio==2.7.1 \\\n"
"  --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128\n"
"uv pip install \"lerobot==0.5.1\"\n"
"\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install numpy pyyaml\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install \"viser>=0.2\"   # optional grasp-generation UI\n"
"uv pip install -e lerobot_robot_ros2 --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install -e lerobot_camera_ros2 --no-deps"
msgstr ""
"git clone --recursive git@github.com:fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2.git\n"
"cd lerobot_ros2\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"\n"
"uv venv --python python3.12 --system-site-packages .venv\n"
"source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"\n"
"uv pip install torch==2.7.1 torchvision==0.22.1 torchaudio==2.7.1 \\\n"
"  --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128\n"
"uv pip install \"lerobot==0.5.1\"\n"
"\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install numpy pyyaml\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install \"viser>=0.2\"   # optional grasp-generation UI\n"
"uv pip install -e lerobot_robot_ros2 --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install -e lerobot_camera_ros2 --no-deps"

msgid "Use `uv pip` inside this checkout's `.venv`, not system `pip` (PEP 668 / `externally-managed-environment`). Do not install `ros2-stack` / `grasp-generation` into `submodules/hug/.venv` (HUG's Python 3.10 env). See the README section on that pitfall."
msgstr "在本仓库的 `.venv` 里用 `uv pip`，不要用系统 `pip`（PEP 668 / `externally-managed-environment`）。不要把 `ros2-stack` / `grasp-generation` 装进 `submodules/hug/.venv`（那是 HUG 的 Python 3.10 环境）。见 README 中该常见坑。"

msgid "Usage: `ROS2Robot`"
msgstr "使用：`ROS2Robot`"

msgid "The public robot plugin is `lerobot_robot_ros2`, not a root package named `lerobot_ros2`. Example from the README:"
msgstr "对外的机器人插件是 `lerobot_robot_ros2`，不是名为 `lerobot_ros2` 的根包。示例来自 README："

msgid ""
"from lerobot_robot_ros2 import ROS2Robot, ROS2RobotConfig, ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig\n"
"\n"
"config = ROS2RobotConfig(\n"
"    id=\"my_robot\",\n"
"    ros2_interface=ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig(\n"
"        joint_states_topic=\"/joint_states\",\n"
"        end_effector_pose_topic=\"/left_current_pose\",\n"
"        end_effector_target_topic=\"/left_target\",\n"
"    ),\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"robot = ROS2Robot(config)\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"# ...\n"
"robot.disconnect()"
msgstr ""
"from lerobot_robot_ros2 import ROS2Robot, ROS2RobotConfig, ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig\n"
"\n"
"config = ROS2RobotConfig(\n"
"    id=\"my_robot\",\n"
"    ros2_interface=ROS2RobotInterfaceConfig(\n"
"        joint_states_topic=\"/joint_states\",\n"
"        end_effector_pose_topic=\"/left_current_pose\",\n"
"        end_effector_target_topic=\"/left_target\",\n"
"    ),\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"robot = ROS2Robot(config)\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"# ...\n"
"robot.disconnect()"

msgid "More examples are under `examples/` on this branch. `lerobot_robot_ros2` depends on the local `ros2-robot-interface` install (`submodules/ros2_robot_interface` first)."
msgstr "更多示例见本分支的 `examples/`。`lerobot_robot_ros2` 依赖本地已安装的 `ros2-robot-interface`（先装 `submodules/ros2_robot_interface`）。"

msgid "Camera plugin"
msgstr "相机插件"

msgid "`lerobot_camera_ros2` defaults to **manual image conversion** (no `cv_bridge`) so it can run with `lerobot==0.5.1` and numpy 2.x. If `cv_bridge` is usable it may be selected automatically. Force the manual path with:"
msgstr "`lerobot_camera_ros2` 默认使用 **manual 图像转换**（不依赖 `cv_bridge`），以便配合 `lerobot==0.5.1` 与 numpy 2.x。若环境支持 `cv_bridge`，会自动尝试使用。强制走 manual 路径："

msgid "export LEROBOT_ROS2_DISABLE_CV_BRIDGE=1"
msgstr "export LEROBOT_ROS2_DISABLE_CV_BRIDGE=1"

msgid "The uv path also expects system `ffmpeg` (for example `sudo apt install ffmpeg`). `install-plugins` additionally installs `scipy>=1.14` so `--system-site-packages` does not pick up a system SciPy that is incompatible with numpy 2.x."
msgstr "uv 路径还需系统已安装 `ffmpeg`（例如 `sudo apt install ffmpeg`）。`install-plugins` 会额外安装 `scipy>=1.14`，避免 `--system-site-packages` 下系统 SciPy 与 numpy 2.x 不兼容。"

